<title>UK: HORSE RACING-MARTHA'S SON WINS QUEEN MOTHER CHAMPION CHASE.</title>
<headline>HORSE RACING-MARTHA'S SON WINS QUEEN MOTHER CHAMPION CHASE.</headline>
<dateline>CHELTENHAM, England 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Martha's Son, owned by P.J.Hartigan and ridden by Rodney Farrant, won the Queen Mother Champion Chase run over two miles (3.2 km) on the second day of the Cheltenham Festival on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Martha's Son is trained in England by Captain Tim Forster.</p>
